{"id":89360,"title":"Scratch. Game creation","lessonId":37621,"moduleNumber":6,"type":"regular","isBonus":false,"levels":[{"id":1750837,"position":1,"type":"mindmap","title":"Game plan","levelScore":1,"isAllowFail":false,"hide":false,"config":{"fail":"","hint":"","math":null,"msgs":"","tips":[],"type":"mindmap","hints":[{"id":"95a6bc51-265d-487a-b8fb-a3cab1368e6c","url":"","text":"","type":"gif","image":null,"title":"Create a game plan","taskType":"basic","imageFull":null,"evaluationType":"markCompleted"}],"title":"","comics":[],"popups":[],"congrat":"","question":"","quizData":[],"roleTips":[],"tutorial":[],"description":"","congrat_repeat":""},"comics":[],"timerType":null,"timerSeconds":null},{"id":1750838,"position":2,"type":"scratch","title":"Creating the Mirrors game","levelScore":1,"isAllowFail":false,"hide":false,"config":{"fail":"","hint":"","math":null,"msgs":"","tips":[],"type":"scratch","hints":[{"id":"16353dde-a512-4722-aa81-13630354b9ba","url":"/vp-assets/uploads/2024/06/unnamed_1718946998.png","text":"When you click on the How to Play button, a sprite with rules will appear. When you click on the sprite with the rules, it disappears.\nWhen you click on the New Game button, the menu disappears and the game background and game sprites appear.","type":"gif","image":{"id":276470,"uid":1718946995358,"url":"/vp-assets/uploads/2024/06/unnamed_1718946998.png","name":"unnamed.png","status":"success","createdAt":1718946998,"updatedAt":1718946998},"title":"Day 1. Create a menu with two buttons","taskType":"basic","imageFull":null,"evaluationType":"markCompleted"},{"id":"bbfa2a58-7f79-4f01-a0b2-e3b178600d6a","url":null,"text":"The cursor should change its shape when pointed at the mirror.","type":null,"image":null,"title":"Day 1. Create a script for the cursor","taskType":"basic","imageFull":null,"evaluationType":"markCompleted"},{"id":"bae8cb53-7c36-45cb-aae7-2653c3b79f9d","url":null,"text":"The mirror should rotate when you click on it with the cursor. The glare should be in the center of the mirror and rotate with it.","type":null,"image":null,"title":"Day 1. Create a script for the glare and mirror","taskType":"basic","imageFull":null,"evaluationType":"markCompleted"},{"id":"62264c2f-f790-4318-bd38-ad6f57c25ef4","url":"/vp-assets/uploads/2024/06/1_1718946987.PNG","text":"Clones of the ray of light fly up and reflect off the mirror. They disappear if they touch the edge or the crystal.","type":"gif","image":{"id":276469,"uid":1718946985170,"url":"/vp-assets/uploads/2024/06/1_1718946987.PNG","name":"1.PNG","status":"success","createdAt":1718946987,"updatedAt":1718946987},"title":"Day 1. Create a script for the rays","taskType":"basic","imageFull":null,"evaluationType":"markCompleted"},{"id":"2fa56209-bdfb-4175-8af7-b0114229328d","url":null,"text":"The crystal brightens when a ray of light hits it. When 10 rays hit the crystal, the game ends.","type":null,"image":null,"title":"Day 2. Create a script for the crystal","taskType":"basic","imageFull":null,"evaluationType":"markCompleted"},{"id":"41c40c0f-d4c1-49f4-8646-407a1a372803","url":"","text":"The final screen with the words \"You won!\" should appear at the end of the game. A second after that, a button appears on the screen to start a new game.","type":"gif","image":null,"title":"Day 2. Make up the end of the game","taskType":"basic","imageFull":null,"evaluationType":"markCompleted"},{"id":"e1c89e66-f640-4d16-a0e5-2362998e413c","url":"","text":"Often, players can return to the menu at the end of the game and start a new game from there. Redesign the project so that instead of the New Game button, the Main Menu button, which takes the player back to the menu, appears on the final screen.","type":"gif","image":null,"title":"Day 2. New game","taskType":"bonus","imageFull":null,"evaluationType":"markCompleted"}],"title":"","comics":[{"url":"/vp-assets/uploads/2018/06/%D1%81%D0%BC%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8C%20%D0%BA%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8E%D0%BC%20%D0%BD%D0%B0.png","type"